\rtlch\fcs1 \af37\afs26\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f37\fs26\lang3081\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp3081\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid4267337\charrsid15410477 1/ C\'e1c lo\u7841\'3fi \'f0\u7845\'3ft \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc mi
\u7877\'3fn thu\u7871\'3f s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng \'f0\u7845\'3ft n\'f4ng nghi\u7879\'3fp
\par Theo quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi \'d0i\u7873\'3fu 14 Ngh\u7883\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh s\u7889\'3f 74/CP ng\'e0y 25/120/1993 c\u7911\'3fa Ch\'ednh ph\u7911\'3f quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh chi ti\u7871\'3ft thi h\'e0nh Lu\u7853\'3ft thu\u7871\'3f s\u7917\'3f d
\u7909\'3fng \'f0\u7845\'3ft n\'f4ng nghi\u7879\'3fp:
\par a) \'d0\u7845\'3ft \'f0\u7891\'3fi n\'fai tr\u7885\'3fc \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc d\'f9ng v\'e0o s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft n\'f4ng nghi\u7879\'3fp, l\'e2m nghi\u7879\'3fp t\u7915\'3f sau ng\'e0y 1 th\'e1ng 1 n\'e3m 1994.
\par b) Th\u7901\'3fi gian x\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng c\'f5 b\u7843\'3fn \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc mi\u7877\'3fn thu\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi \'f0\u7845\'3ft khai hoang d\'f9ng v\'e0o tr\u7891\'3fng c\'e2y l\'e2u n\'e3m, \'f0\u7845\'3ft tr\u7891\'3fng c\'e2
y l\'e2u n\'e3m chuy\u7875\'3fn sang tr\u7891\'3fng l\u7841\'3fi m\u7899\'3fi v\'e0 \'f0\u7845\'3ft tr\u7891\'3fng c\'e2y h\'e0ng n\'e3m chuy\u7875\'3fn sang tr\u7891\'3fng c\'e2y l\'e2u n\'e3m, c\'e2y \'e3n qu\u7843\'3f (\'e1p d\u7909\'3fng c\u7843\'3f 
\'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi ph\'fd\'f5ng ph\'e1p tr\u7891\'3fng chi\u7871\'3ft gh\'e9p) l\'e0 th\u7901\'3fi gian x\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng c\'f5 b\u7843\'3fn th\u7921\'3fc t\u7871\'3f c\u7911\'3fa t\u7915\'3fng lo\u7841\'3fi c\'e2y l\'e2u n\'e3m g\u7855\'3f
n v\u7899\'3fi t\u7915\'3fng ph\'fd\'f5ng ph\'e1p tr\u7891\'3fng (tr\u7891\'3fng h\u7841\'3ft, tr\u7891\'3fng b\u7857\'3fng chi\u7871\'3ft, gh\'e9p) do UBND T\u7881\'3fnh, Th\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f tr\u7921\'3fc thu\u7897\'3fc Trung \'fd\'f5ng quy \'f0\u7883
\'3fnh theo h\'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn t\u7841\'3fi c\'f4ng v\'e3n s\u7889\'3f 628 TC/TCT ng\'e0y 19/3/1994 c\u7911\'3fa B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh th\u7901\'3fi gian x\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng c\'f5 b\u7843\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa m\u7897
\'3ft s\u7889\'3f lo\u7841\'3fi c\'e2y tr\u7891\'3fng ch\'ednh.
\par Th\u7901\'3fi gian mi\u7877\'3fn thu\u7871\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc c\u7897\'3fng th\'eam sau th\u7901\'3fi gian x\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng c\'f5 b\u7843\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa c\'e2y l\'e2u n\'e3m tr\u7891\'3fng b\u7857\'3fng ph\'fd\'f5ng ph\'e1p chi\u7871\'3ft gh
\'e9p do UBND T\u7881\'3fnh, Th\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f tr\u7921\'3fc thu\u7897\'3fc Trung \'fd\'f5ng quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh cho ph\'f9 h\u7907\'3fp v\u7899\'3fi t\u7915\'3fng lo\u7841\'3fi c\'e2y tr\u7891\'3fng \u7903\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng v\'e0 h
\u7907\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af39\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f39\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid4267337\charrsid15410477 p l\'fd \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid4267337\charrsid15410477 \u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c c\'e2y tr\u7891\'3fng kh\'e1
c, nh\'fdng t\u7889\'3fi \'f0a kh\'f4ng qu\'e1 th\u7901\'3fi gian quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi kho\u7843\'3fn 2, kho\u7843\'3fn 3 v\'e0 kho\u7843\'3fn 4, \'d0i\u7873\'3fu 14 Ngh\u7883\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh s\u7889\'3f 74/ CP ng\'e0y 25/10/1993 c\u7911
