\par c) \'d0\u7845\'3ft khai hoang b\u7857\'3fng ngu\u7891\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn c\u7845\'3fp ph\'e1t c\u7911\'3fa Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc mi\u7877\'3fn thu\u7871\'3f v\'e0 gi\u7843\'3fm thu\u7871\'3f theo quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t
