c c\u7845\'3fp v\u7889\'3fn ho\u7863\'3fc v\u7889\'3fn c\'f3 ngu\u7891\'3fn g\u7889\'3fc t\u7915\'3f Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc theo quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi m\u7909\'3fc I, c\'f4ng v\'e3n s\u7889\'3f 144 TC/TCT ng\'e0y 27/1/1992 c
\u7911\'3fa B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh h\'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f thu tr\'ean v\u7889\'3fn  Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Nh\'e0-N\'fd\u7899\'3fc \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f n
