\par c. H\u7897\'3f n\u7897\'3fp thu\u7871\'3f m\'e0 \'f0\u7901\'3fi s\u7889\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid4267337\charrsid15410477 ng c\'f2n nhi}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
