\'f3 nhi\u7873\'3fu kh\'f3 kh\'e3n \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc xem x\'e9t mi\u7877\'3fn ho\u7863\'3fc gi\u7843\'3fm thu\u7871\'3f s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng \'f0\u7845\'3ft n\'f4ng nghi\u7879\'3fp theo quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi \'d0i\u7873\'3fu 16 Ngh
\u7883\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh s\u7889\'3f 74/CP ng\'e0y 25/10/1993 c\u7911\'3fa Ch\'ednh ph\u7911\'3f l\'e0 nh\u7919\'3fng h\u7897\'3f sau:
\par + Ch\u7911\'3f h\u7897\'3f gi\'e0 y\u7871\'3fu, c\'f4 \'f0\'f5n, kh\'f4ng c\'f3 n\'f5i n\'fd\'f5ng t\u7921\'3fa, ho\u7863\'3fc g\u7863\'3fp tai n\u7841\'3fn b\u7845\'3ft ng\u7901\'3f, ho\u7863\'3fc  ch\u7911\'3f h\u7897\'3f l\'e0 lao \'f0\u7897\'3fng ch
\'ednh b\u7883\'3f \u7889\'3fm \'f0au k\'e9o d\'e0i;
