i d\'fd\u7905\'3fng t\u7915\'3f 3 ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi tr\u7903\'3f l\'ean.
\par 3) Tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp gi\u7843\'3fm, mi\u7877\'3fn thu\u7871\'3f do thi\'ean tai l\'e0m m\'f9a m\'e0ng b\u7883\'3f thi\u7879\'3ft h\u7841\'3fi.
\par Ph\'fd\'f5ng ph\'e1p t\'ednh gi\u7843\'3fm thu\u7871\'3f, mi\u7877\'3fn thu\u7871\'3f khi c\'f3 thi\'ean tai \'f0\u7883\'3fch ho\u7841\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn theo quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi m\u7909\'3fc V Th\'f4ng  t
\'fd s\u7889\'3f 89 TC/TCT ng\'e0y 9/11/1993 c\u7911\'3fa B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh v\'e0 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc c\u7909\'3f th\u7875\'3f th\'eam m\u7897\'3ft s\u7889\'3f \'f0i\u7875\'3fm nh\'fd sau:
\par a. Thi\'ean tai, \'f0\u7883\'3fch ho\u7841\'3f l\'e0m m\'f9a m\'e0ng thi\u7879\'3ft h\u7841\'3fi \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc x\'e9t gi\u7843\'3fm ho\u7863\'3fc mi\u7877\'3fn thu\u7871\'3f g\u7891\'3fm:
\par - \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi \'f0\u7845\'3ft tr\u7891\'3fng c\'e2y h\'e0ng n\'e3m l\'e0 thi\u7879\'3ft h\u7841\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid4267337\charrsid15410477 i do b\'e3o, l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
