\u7841\'3fch t\u7915\'3f 10%  \'f0\u7871\'3fn 40% \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc gi\u7843\'3fm thu\u7871\'3f, t\u7915\'3f 40% tr\u7903\'3f l\'ean \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc mi\u7877\'3fn thu\u7871\'3f;
\par - \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi \'f0\u7845\'3ft tr\u7891\'3fng c\'e2y l\'e2u n\'e3m v\'e0 m\u7863\'3ft n\'fd\u7899\'3fc nu\'f4i tr\u7891\'3fng thu\u7927\'3f s\u7843\'3fn, thi\u7879\'3ft h\u7841\'3fi do thi\'ean tai, \'f0\u7883\'3fch ho\u7841\'3f l\'e0m gi
\u7843\'3fm c\u7843\'3f s\u7843\'3fn l\'fd\u7907\'3fng v\'e0 gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f s\u7843\'3fn l\'fd\u7907\'3fng. C\'e3n c\u7913\'3f v\'e0o th\u7921\'3fc t\u7871\'3f c\u7911\'3fa t\u7915\'3fng \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng v\'e0 theo c\'e1ch \'f0\'e1nh  gi
\'e1 m\u7913\'3fc \'f0\u7897\'3f thi\u7879\'3ft h\u7841\'3fi v\u7873\'3f s\u7843\'3fn l\'fd\u7907\'3fng ho\u7863\'3fc gi\'e1  tr\u7883\'3f s\u7843\'3fn l\'fd\u7907\'3fng nh\'fd \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi \'f0\u7845\'3ft tr\u7891\'3fng c\'e2y h\'e0ng n
\'e3m; UBND t\u7881\'3fnh, th\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f tr\u7921\'3fc thu\u7897\'3fc Trung \'fd\'f5ng quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh m\u7913\'3fc thi\u7879\'3ft h\u7841\'3fi \'f0\u7875\'3f x\'e9t gi\u7843\'3fm, mi\u7877\'3fn thu\u7871\'3f cho   ph\'f9 h\u7907\'3fp v\u7899
\'3fi t\u7915\'3fng lo\u7841\'3fi \'f0\u7845\'3ft tr\u7891\'3fng c\'e2y l\'e2u n\'e3m v\'e0 nu\'f4i tr\u7891\'3fng thu\u7927\'3f s\u7843\'3fn \u7903\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng.
\par b. N\'e3ng su\u7845\'3ft d\'f9ng \'f0\u7875\'3f t\'ednh t\u7927\'3f l\u7879\'3f (%) thi\u7879\'3ft h\u7841\'3fi do thi\'ean tai l\'e0m c\'e3n c\u7913\'3f x\'e9t gi\u7843\'3fm, mi\u7877\'3fn thu\u7871\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh nh\'fd
 sau:
