\u7845\'3ft tham kh\u7843\'3fo khi ph\'e2n h\u7841\'3fng \'f0\u7845\'3ft t\'ednh thu\u7871\'3f. Nh\'fdng t\u7889\'3fi \'f0a, n\'e3ng su\u7845\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid4267337\charrsid15410477 t b\'ecnh qu\'e2n 1 }{
