c/ha; \'d0\u7845\'3ft h\u7841\'3fng 2 kh\'f4ng q\'faa 3000 kg th\'f3c/ha. \'d0\u7845\'3ft h\u7841\'3fng 3 kh\'f4ng qu\'e1 2500 kg th\'f3c/ha ;\'d0\u7845\'3ft h\u7841\'3fng 4 kh\'f4ng qu\'e1 2000 kg th\'f3c/ha m\u7897\'3ft v\u7909\'3f. U\u7927\'3f ban nh
\'e2n t\u7881\'3fnh, th\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f tr\u7921\'3fc thu\u7897\'3fc Trung \'fd\'f5ng quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh cho \'f0\u7845\'3ft h\u7841\'3fng 5 v\'e0 h\u7841\'3fng 6 cho ph\'f9 h\u7907\'3fp v\u7899\'3fi n\'e3ng su\u7845\'3ft tham kh\u7843\'3fo c\u7911
\'3fa h\u7841\'3fng \'f0\u7845\'3ft.
\par - \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi \'f0\u7845\'3ft tr\u7891\'3fng c\'e2y l\'e2u n\'e3m v\'e0 m\u7863\'3ft n\'fd\u7899\'3fc m\u7863\'3fn, l\u7907\'3f nu\'f4i tr\u7891\'3fng thu\u7927\'3f s\u7843\'3fn, vi\u7879\'3fc x\'e1c \'f0\u7883\'3fnh n\'e3ng su\u7845\'3f
