n t\u7915\'3fng h\u7841\'3fng \'f0\u7845\'3ft t\'ednh thu\u7871\'3f \u7903\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng.
\par C\u7909\'3fc thu\u7871\'3f ph\u7889\'3fi h\u7907\'3fp v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c ng\'e0nh c\'f3 li\'ean quan (n\'f4ng nghi\u7879\'3fp, th\u7889\'3fng k\'ea . . .) x\'e1c \'f0\u7883\'3fnh s\u7843\'3fn l\'fd\u7907\'3fng thu ho\u7841\'3fch th\u7921\'3fc t\u7871\'3f
 tr\'ean \'f0\u7845\'3ft tr\u7891\'3fng c\'e2y l\'e2u n\'e3m, \'f0\u7845\'3ft c\'f3 m\u7863\'3ft n\'fd\u7899\'3fc nu\'f4i tr\u7891\'3fng thu\u7927\'3f s\u7843\'3fn theo t\u7915\'3fng lo\u7841\'3fi n\'f4ng s\u7843\'3fn, thu\u7927\'3f s\u7843\'3fn ho\u7863
\'3fc quy \'f0\u7893\'3fi t\u7927\'3f l\u7879\'3f c\'e1c lo\u7841\'3fi hi\u7879\'3fn v\u7853\'3ft n\'f4ng s\u7843\'3fn thu\u7927\'3f s\u7843\'3fn ra th\'f3c \'f0\u7875\'3f l\'e0m c\'e3n c\u7913\'3f x\'e1c \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7927\'3f l\u7879\'3f thi\u7879
\'3ft h\u7841\'3fi tr\'ean t\u7915\'3fng h\u7841\'3fng \'f0\u7845\'3ft theo m\u7897\'3ft trong hai ph\'fd\'f5ng ph\'e1p tr\'ean \'f0\'e2y.
\par Vi\u7879\'3fc x\'e1c \'f0\u7883\'3fnh s\u7843\'3fn l\'fd\u7907\'3fng ho\u7863\'3fc gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f s\u7843\'3fn l\'fd\u7907\'3fng thu ho\u7841\'3fch th\u7921\'3fc t\u7871\'3f khi c\'f3 thi\'ean tai l\'e0m m\'f9a m\'e0ng thi\u7879\'3ft h\u7841\'3fi 
\'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn theo 1 trong 2 ph\'fd\'f5ng ph\'e1p tr\'ean \'f0\'e2y ph\'f9 h\u7907\'3fp v\u7899\'3fi ph\'fd\'f5ng ph\'e1p \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid4267337\charrsid15410477 \'e3 
