nh c}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid4267337\charrsid15410477 \u7911\'3fa h\u7841\'3fng \'f0\u7845\'3ft t\'ednh thu\u7871\'3f.
\par Tu\u7923\'3f \'f0\u7863\'3fc \'f0i\u7875\'3fm c\u7911\'3fa t\u7915\'3fng \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng m\'e0 \'e1p d\u7909\'3fng 1 trong 2 ph\'fd\'f5ng ph\'e1p tr\'ean cho ph\'f9 h\u7907\'3fp v\u7899\'3fi th\u7921\'3fc t\u7871\'3f v\'e0 b\'e1o c\'e1o B
\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh (T\u7893\'3fng c\u7909\'3fc thu\u7871\'3f).
\par c. V\u7873\'3f gi\u7843\'3fm mi\u7877\'3fn thu\u7871\'3f theo v\u7909\'3f: Ch\u7881\'3f \'e1p d\u7909\'3fng cho c\'e1c \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn l\u7853\'3fp s\u7893\'3f thu\u7871\'3f theo v\u7909\'3f ngay t\u7915\'3f \'f0
\u7847\'3fu n\'e3m, \'f0\'fang th\u7901\'3fi h\u7841\'3fn quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi \'d0i\u7873\'3fu 9 Ngh\u7883\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh s\u7889\'3f 74/CP ng\'e0y 25/10/1993 c\u7911\'3fa Ch\'ednh ph\u7911\'3f.
\par Vi\u7879\'3fc l\u7853\'3fp s\u7893\'3f thu\u7871\'3f theo v\u7909\'3f theo nguy\'ean t\u7855\'3fc ru\u7897\'3fng \'f0\u7845\'3ft thu ho\u7841\'3fch \u7903\'3f v\u7909\'3f n\'e0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
