i khai b\'e1o v\u7899\'3fi c\'f5 quan thu\u7871\'3f v\u7873\'3f: Lo\u7841\'3fi \'f0\u7845\'3ft (\'f0\u7845\'3ft \'f0\u7891\'3fi tr\u7885\'3fc, \'f0\u7845\'3ft khai hoang . . .) c\'f3 x\'e1c nh\u7853\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa ng\'e0nh \'f0\u7883\'3fa ch\'ednh v
\u7873\'3f di\u7879\'3fn t\'edch v\'e0 th\u7901\'3fi gian s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng \'f0\u7845\'3ft. \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi \'f0\u7845\'3ft tr\u7891\'3fng c\'e1c lo\u7841\'3fi c\'e2y l\'e2u n\'e3m ph\u7843\'3fi khai b\'e1o n\'e3m tr\u7891\'3fng, ph
\'fd\'f5ng ph\'e1p tr\u7891\'3fng, th\u7901\'3fi gian b\u7855\'3ft \'f0\u7847\'3fu cho thu ho\u7841\'3fch. \'d0\u7845\'3ft r\u7915\'3fng tr\u7891\'3fng \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc mi\u7877\'3fn thu\u7871\'3f ph\u7843\'3fi \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc c\'f5 quan Nh\'e0 n
